756 /// A credential-free identity for one configured registry binding.
757 ///
758 /// This is intentionally not a URL. `registry_key` says which configured
759 /// target was selected, while `binding_digest` commits to the graph-normalized
760 /// target that will receive the effect. Durable intents never retain the raw
761 /// endpoint, credentials, query parameters, or fragments.
762 #[derive(Clone, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Hash, PartialOrd, Ord, Serialize, JsonSchema)]
